# History entries prior to 11.0

4-August-2021 Ben Morgan (test33-V10-07-06)
- Modernize CMake script allowing test to be built in system testing
  or as a standalone project

5-May-2021 Ben Morgan (tes33-V10-07-05)
- Do not install tests

18-Mar-2021 Alberto Ribon (test33-V10-07-04)
- Tst33PhysicsList : replaced G4HadronCaptureProcess with
  G4NeutronCaptureProcess.

11-Mar-2021 Alberto Ribon (test33-V10-07-03)
- Tst33PhysicsList : replaced stopping processes that have been deleted.

08-Mar-2021 Alberto Ribon (test33-V10-07-02)
- Tst33PhysicsList : replaced old pion inelastic cross sections
  (that have been deleted) with G4BGGPionInelasticXS.

04-Mar-2021 Alberto Ribon (test33-V10-07-01)
- Tst33PhysicsList : replaced particle-specific inelastic hadronic
  processes (that have been deleted) with G4HadronInelasticProcess.

18-Feb-2021 Ben Morgan (test33-V10-07-00)
- Support same CMake version range as core Geant4

07-Nov-2019 A. Ribon        (test33-V10-05-01)
- Tst33PhysicsList : added explicit header files for Chips cross sections,
  to avoid compilation errors.

09-May-2019 V. Ivanchenko   (test33-V10-05-00)
- Tst33PhysicsList : defined default x-sections for all hadrons

07-November-2018 V. Ivanchenko   (test33-V10-04-01)
- Tst33PhysicsList : use Binary cascade for light ions instead of
    Bertini to fix run time crash; fixed EM physics definition

09-August-2018 A. Ribon   (test33-V10-04-00)
- Tst33PhysicsList : replaced the explicit high-energy limit of hadronic
  physics with the one from G4HadronicParameters .

13-October-2016 G.Folger  (test33-V10-02-00)
- remove direct use of theParticleIterator, use GetParticleTableIterator().

October 27th, 2015 A. Ribon    - test33-V10-01-00
- Tst33PhysicsList: replaced old G4GGNuclNuclCrossSection class with
                    the new, recommended one, G4ComponentGGNuclNuclXsc .

March 11th, 2014 L. Garnier    - test33-V10-00-00
